LIST OF FILES
=============

BOARD                      : one liner board description

I2C slave:
  main.py                  : executable application entry point
  controller.py            : generic payload processor
  payload.py               : payload wrapper with CRC
  response.py              : transaction responses
  i2c_slave.py             : basic I2C slave as a loop
  RP2040_I2C_Registers.py  : RP2040 constants
  rp2040_slave.py          : RP2040 I2C slave implementation

utility and support files:
  core/logger.py           : console logger
  colorama.py              : console colored output
  colors.py                : enumeration of some RGB colors
  itertools.py             : MicroPython port of itertools

display files:

  neopixel.py              : support for Neopixel RGB LED
  abstract_display.py      : API for displays (LEDs)
  ws2812_display.py        : implementation for WS2812 RGB LED
  neopixel_display.py      : implementation for Neopixel
  pico_display.py          : implementation for Pico red LED

